{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47837","headline":"留别卢陲 · 崔少玄","name":"留别卢陲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得之一元，匪受自天。\n太老之真，无上之僊。\n光含影藏，形于自然。\n真安匪求，神之久留。\n淑美其真，体性刚柔。\n丹霄碧虚，上圣之俦。\n百岁之後，空余坟丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔少玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}